W:You're a grand old flag, you're a high flying flag,
W:and forever in peace may  you wave.  You're the
W: Emblem of, the land I love,
W: the home of the, free and the brave.  Every
W: Heart beats true, under Red, White and Blue.
W: Where there's never a boast or brag; "But should
W: Auld acquaintance be forgot," Keep you're eye on the grand old flag.
